== 6. Source ==
cmd/handoff/session.go, holds and waitFence: the new checks sit only in the branch for a
wait whose session did not hold the role when it began (!held). The spare's own wait is
held, so it is untouched (U1, F3). waitFence's check runs under the record's read lock,
which bind takes for writing, so a delivery and a session's becoming the spare can't cross.
